# Balance Switchback — AI balance fixture (never shipped). D3-like: 13 m road, two R14 hairpins back to back,
# a 90° R18 entry, a fast chicane and two sweepers. Checks that tier pace holds on technical corners too.
TRACK bal_switchback name="Balance Switchback" theme=spark_circuit diff=3 laps=3 topo=circuit
DEFAULTS w=13 surf=asphalt wall=barrier:1.0 shoulder=1 shoulderSurf=grass blend=12
START pos=(0,0,0) hdg=0
GRID rows=4 cols=2 pitch=7 stagger=3.5 d=3
S ?a                      @home
C R18 90 L                @entry
S 60
HAIRPIN R14 R             @hairpin1
S 50
HAIRPIN R14 L             @hairpin2
S ?b                      @back
C R20 90 L                @drop
S ?c                      @west
CHICANE R40 30/60/30 L    @chicane
S 60
C R24 90 L                @south
S 100
C R30 90 L                @last
CLOSE solve=[?a,?b,?c] length=1100
LINE start at=120
THEME scatter=none density=0 hills=0 sky=noon
